## What was actually used for the replication

- `paper.txt` (62,659 bytes) — grep-friendly text extract, sufficient for method/claim verification.
- `paper.html` (188,583 bytes) — HTML render.
- `mendeley_data/*.xlsx` — raw per-replicate source data (this is what drove the numerical
  replication; PDF text was not the critical input).

No Nougat structural extraction is required to close this replication.
